{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-97",
  "title": "Multi-Tenant Agentic Architecture",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Multi-Tenant Agentic Architecture"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Multi-Tenant Agentic Web App Architecture Framework**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When designing a **multi-tenant, agentic web app** that interacts with data from multiple sources, you need a framework that balances **scalability, security, modularity, and automation**. Below is a structured approach to guide your architectural thinking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Core Architecture Principles**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Before diving into specifics, keep these high-level principles in mind:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Modular Design** – Keep components loosely coupled and scalable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Tenant Isolation** – Ensure data privacy and logical separation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Extensibility** – Enable easy integration of new data sources."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Scalability** – Allow for horizontal scaling across tenants."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Security by Design** – Implement authentication, authorization, and encryption."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Observability** – Include logging, monitoring, and debugging tools."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. **Agentic Autonomy** – Agents should have their own decision-making capabilities."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Architectural Layers**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your system should be broken into clear, modular layers:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**A. Tenant Management & Identity Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Handles user accounts, authentication, and multi-tenancy logic."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**User Authentication & Authorization** (OAuth, JWT, OIDC)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) / Attribute-Based Access Control (ABAC)**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tenant Data Partitioning** (Separate databases vs. shared DB with row-level security)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Multi-Tenancy Strategy:**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Siloed:** Separate database per tenant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Pool:** Shared database with tenant IDs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Hybrid:** Mix of both for flexibility"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**B. Data Ingestion & Processing Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Handles data connectivity, retrieval, and transformation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Data Source Connectors**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "APIs, Webhooks, SQL/NoSQL Databases, Data Warehouses, File-based sources (CSV, JSON, Parquet)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Streaming sources (Kafka, RabbitMQ)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. ETL/ELT Pipelines**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Extract**: Fetch data from sources (batch/real-time)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Transform**: Normalize, clean, and structure data (Airflow, dbt, custom workflows)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Load**: Store in a central repository (SQL, NoSQL, Object Storage)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Data Synchronization**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Event-driven updates** (Kafka, Pub/Sub, Webhooks)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Scheduled pulls** (cron jobs, background workers)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**C. Data Storage Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Stores and organizes tenant-specific data."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Operational Databases** (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Analytical Storage** (Data Lakes, Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Vector Databases** (Pinecone, Weaviate, FAISS) for AI-powered search"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Caching Layer** (Redis, Memcached) to optimize agent performance"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**D. AI/Agentic Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Powers autonomous decision-making and data interactions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Core Agent Framework**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Autonomous agents (LangChain, AutoGen, custom)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Task orchestration (Celery, Prefect)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Memory and context management (persistent vs. stateless)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Capabilities**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data Analysis** (SQL generation, statistics, AI-enhanced insights)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data Transformation** (Schema inference, NLP-based categorization)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Decision-Making** (Reinforcement Learning, Planning)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Human-in-the-loop interaction** (Approval flows, Notifications)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. LLM/AI Model Integration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "OpenAI, Anthropic, Cohere, fine-tuned local models"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "On-prem or API-based LLMs"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**E. API Gateway & Orchestration Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Exposes services securely to external users or other services."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**GraphQL/REST API Layer**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Rate Limiting & Throttling** (Kong, Envoy, API Gateway)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Load Balancing** (Nginx, AWS ALB)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Middleware** (JWT validation, request logging)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**F. Frontend/UI Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User interface for interacting with the system."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**React/Next.js, Vue, Svelte**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Realtime dashboards** (WebSockets, SSE)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data Visualization** (D3.js, Plotly, Grafana)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Conversational Interfaces** (Chatbots, interactive agent UIs)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**G. Security & Compliance Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ensures tenant isolation and regulatory compliance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data Encryption** (AES-256, TLS)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Audit Logs** (Immutable logs, event tracing)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-82",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Compliance Standards** (SOC2, GDPR, HIPAA)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-83",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**DDoS Protection & WAF** (Cloudflare, AWS Shield)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**H. DevOps & Observability Layer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Maintains system reliability and performance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**CI/CD Pipelines** (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD, ArgoCD)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Infrastructure as Code (IaC)** (Terraform, Pulumi)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-89",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Monitoring & Alerting** (Prometheus, Grafana, Datadog)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-90",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Logging & Tracing** (ELK Stack, OpenTelemetry)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Multi-Tenancy Approaches**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Choose based on isolation needs and scalability:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Approach | Pros | Cons |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Database per Tenant** | Strong isolation, security | Higher costs, complex scaling |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Shared DB with Tenant ID** | Cost-effective, easier to manage | Requires strict row-level security |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Hybrid (Partitioning by Needs)** | Balance between cost and isolation | Adds operational complexity |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Example Tech Stack**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Layer | Tech Options |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Frontend** | React, Next.js, Vue |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **API Gateway** | GraphQL, REST (FastAPI, Express, NestJS) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Authentication** | Auth0, Firebase Auth, Keycloak |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Agent Framework** | LangChain, AutoGen, Custom Python-based |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **LLM APIs** | OpenAI, Anthropic, Cohere |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-107",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Databases** | PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-108",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Vector DB** | Pinecone, Weaviate, FAISS |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
