    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Define Your Multi-Tenancy Model** – Isolation vs. cost trade-offs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Select Core Technologies** – Choose best-fit DBs, frameworks, AI tools."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Design a Scalable Data Pipeline** – ETL, event-driven updates, caching."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Prototype Agentic Capabilities** – Start with basic automation and scale up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Deploy Iteratively** – Use feature flags, A/B testing for rollout."
        }
      ]
